<title>UK: UK 100 mln stg bond tranche due 2006 exhausted.</title>
<headline>UK 100 mln stg bond tranche due 2006 exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said a 100 million stg tap offer of 7.75 percent Treasury stock due 2006 was exhausted and no longer operating as a tranchette after the bonds were supplied at 101.31.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
